  "note": "Phase 0, complete three-arm set, first run on a repaired instrument (D017). Every previous arm is void: NVIDIAProvider returned the HTTP envelope as raw_output and validator.grounding.extract_json takes the first BALANCED JSON object, so the validator read the envelope as the model's answer; supported is absent from an envelope, so all 68 decided items were flagged not_answerable_from_passage. 91 of 94 grounding calls. Also fixed: content_of concatenated content and reasoning_content, costing 93 of 340 parses; and a reply truncated at max_tokens was scavenged for a JSON fragment out of the model's reasoning. max_tokens 1024 to 4096 in all three layers, measured from 63 of 340 replies truncating at exactly 1024 with 52 emitting no answer, which put the clean arm below the 35-item floor its own gate needs. Pairing unchanged and re-derived by the D011 rule; thresholds, corpus, prompts, temperature, retry policy and call budget unchanged.",
